    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ruthless shoes of a leader hungry for global domination! This high-stakes strategy game challenges you to build your nation\u2019s economy, conquer rival territories, and crush anyone who dares to stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491200/extras/fca5b589c5f02b928a1a09a077a64043.poster.avif?t=1739873278\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491200/extras/fca5b589c5f02b928a1a09a077a64043.webm?t=1739873278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491200/extras/fca5b589c5f02b928a1a09a077a64043.mp4?t=1739873278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a struggling nation, wield your cunning, and grow your production capabilities. Exploit the resources of weaker countries, expand your territory, and grow your empire. Each conquest fuels your economy, giving you the power to upgrade industries, build stronger defenses, and prepare for the battles ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491200/extras/a759cb4fdde8b0c542590dd4ad517d21.poster.avif?t=1739873278\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491200/extras/a759cb4fdde8b0c542590dd4ad517d21.webm?t=1739873278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491200/extras/a759cb4fdde8b0c542590dd4ad517d21.mp4?t=1739873278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the path to world domination is never easy. Enemies are watching your every move and won\u2019t hesitate to strike back. Defend your empire by strategically upgrading your military and fortifying your borders. And when all else fails, unleash the devastating power of a <strong>nuclear strike</strong>, reducing your enemies to nothing and leaving their lands ripe for your taking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise to Power:</strong> Start from a small nation and grow into a superpower by dominating weaker countries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer and Profit:</strong> Every conquered territory boosts your production and resources, fueling your war machine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend and Expand:</strong> Protect your empire from enemy invasions with upgraded defenses and strategic planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Destruction:</strong> Use nuclear strikes to obliterate enemy nations, leaving them powerless to resist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Domination:</strong> Take over the entire world and cement your legacy as the ultimate dictator.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491200/extras/0b5a300c5ebf1ee7e36c2999d5f39758.poster.avif?t=1739873278\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491200/extras/0b5a300c5ebf1ee7e36c2999d5f39758.webm?t=1739873278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491200/extras/0b5a300c5ebf1ee7e36c2999d5f39758.mp4?t=1739873278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge alliances, break them, and crush your enemies in the relentless pursuit of power. Whether through economic strength, military might, or pure devastation, your destiny is to rule the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become the most feared dictator in history? Play <i>Dictator\u2019s Dominion: No Mercy</i> today and show the world that mercy is for the weak!</p>",
